    "contents": [
      "html | <div style=\"font-size:6.5pt;color:#555;margin-bottom:3px;\">Source Player Core p. 259</div>",
      "text | <b>Razing</b> This weapon is particularly good at damaging objects, structures, and vehicles. Whenever you deal damage to an object (including shields and animated objects), structure, or vehicle with a razing weapon, the object takes an amount of additional damage equal to double the number of weapon damage dice.",
      "text | <b>Unwieldy</b> You can’t use an unwieldy weapon more than once per round to Strike and can’t use it to Strike as part of a reaction, such as Reactive Strike."
    ],
